<PageTitle>Tech News Aggregator</PageTitle>

<h1>Multi-Source Tech News Aggregator</h1>

<p>
    A .NET 10 scaffold: Blazor Server UI, Microsoft Agent Framework workflows,
    Microsoft.Extensions.AI model abstraction, local Ollama + BYOK OpenRouter
    providers, composed with .NET Aspire.
</p>

<p>
    This is a foundation only — collection logic and agent workflows are not yet
    implemented. Open the <a href="/digest">Digest</a> page to see the application
    service boundary wired up.
</p>
